{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55585","headline":"始迁青溪望吴兴故里 · 吴党","name":"始迁青溪望吴兴故里","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生愿嗣叔庠微，谁识飘零事已非。\n霅水远从云外隔，澄江独向月中归。\n烟横野渡行舟稳，露下衡门步屐稀。\n潮夕不通音问杳，故乡冷落钓鱼矶。\n（光绪十年刊李诗纂《淳安县志》卷十五，原署：「周吴党。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴党","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}